  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "test1 = OPE[R[dX[\\[Mu], 0, z]], R[dX[\\[Nu], 0, w]]];\nexpected1 = R[dX[\\[Mu], 0, z], dX[\\[Nu], 0, w]] - \\[Alpha]p \\[Delta][\\[Mu], \\[Nu]]/(2 (z - w)^2);\ntest1Result = Simplify[test1 - expected1] === 0;\nPrint[\"Test 1 (OPE dX-dX): \", If[test1Result, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED\"]];\ntest1Result",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
